## Backend — Routes, Controllers & Models

### New Routes ([public/index.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/index.php))
```php
// Auth (enhanced)
$router->post('api/auth/staff-login',        ['AuthController', 'staffLogin']);
$router->post('api/auth/staff-register',     ['AuthController', 'staffRegister']);
$router->post('api/auth/logout',             ['AuthController', 'logout']);
$router->get ('api/auth/check',              ['AuthController', 'checkSession']);
$router->post('api/auth/verify-user',        ['AuthController', 'verifyUser']);    // future

// Query Threads
$router->get ('api/queries/list',            ['QueryController', 'listQueries']);
$router->get ('api/queries/thread',          ['QueryController', 'getThread']);
$router->post('api/queries/respond',         ['QueryController', 'submitResponse']);
$router->post('api/queries/assign',          ['QueryController', 'assignQuery']);
$router->post('api/queries/set-priority',    ['QueryController', 'setPriority']);
$router->post('api/queries/close',           ['QueryController', 'closeQuery']);
$router->post('api/queries/close-cold',      ['QueryController', 'closeColdQuery']);
$router->post('api/queries/add-note',        ['QueryController', 'addResponseNote']);
$router->post('api/queries/prune-archive',   ['QueryController', 'pruneToArchive']);
$router->get ('api/queries/cold-audit',      ['QueryController', 'getColdThreads']);

// Notifications
$router->get ('api/notifications/unread',    ['QueryController', 'getUnreadNotifications']);
$router->post('api/notifications/mark-read', ['QueryController', 'markNotificationsRead']);
```

### [AuthController.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/AuthController.php) — Upgraded Methods

| Method | What Changes |
|---|---|
| `staffLogin()` *(new)* | Authenticates staff/partner, starts secure PHP session, sets `HttpOnly` + `Secure` + `SameSite=Strict` cookie (`ab_session`), redirects or returns user data |
| `staffRegister()` *(new)* | Registers staff member, starts session, returns user data |
| `logout()` *(new)* | Destroys session + expires cookie |
| `checkSession()` *(new)* | Returns session state; used by frontend to gate protected pages |
| `verifyUser()` *(future scaffold)* | Placeholder for OTP/email verification flow |
| Existing [login()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/AuthController.php#20-42) / [register()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/AuthController.php#43-84) | Kept unchanged (customer-facing JSON API) |

**Session structure** (`$_SESSION`):
```php
$_SESSION['user'] = [
  'id'    => $userId,
  'name'  => $name,
  'role'  => 'Admin' | 'SeniorAdmin' | 'WHM' | 'SBA' | 'ZBDp' | 'Agent',
  'type'  => 'staff' | 'partner',
  'login_at' => time(),
];
```

Cookie: `ab_session` — stores the PHP session ID with `HttpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict`, expiry = `session_lifetime_minutes` setting.

**PHP helper functions** (added to [core/helpers/functions.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/helpers/functions.php)):
- `authGuard($allowedRoles)` — reads session; if invalid/expired, redirects to login
- `currentUser()` — returns `$_SESSION['user']` or null
- `forceLogin($redirectAfter)` — redirects to login page with return URL
- `forceVerify()` — redirects to verification page (future)

**PHP-injected JS variables** (on every dashboard page, top of `<script>` block, for dev use):
```php
<script>
  window.currentUser = {
    id:   <?= $sessionUser['id'] ?? 1 ?>,
    name: "<?= $sessionUser['name'] ?? 'Admin' ?>",
    role: "<?= $sessionUser['role'] ?? 'Admin' ?>"
  };
</script>
```

### [QueryController.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/QueryController.php) — All Methods

| Method | Purpose | Access |
|---|---|---|
| [addQuery()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/QueryController.php#17-43) *(refine)* | Create new query; uses `window.currentUser` params | All roles |
| `listQueries()` | All open threads, filterable | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `getThread()` | Full thread + responses + notes | Involved roles |
| `submitResponse()` | Add response + optional forward + notify | Involved roles |
| `assignQuery()` | Assign unassigned query + notify | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `setPriority()` | Reset priority + reassign + notify | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `closeQuery()` | Originator closes own thread + notify | Originator only |
| `closeColdQuery()` | Force-close with password + audit log | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `addResponseNote()` | Comment note on a response | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `pruneToArchive()` | Archive closed threads >28 days | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `getColdThreads()` | Open threads stale >4 days | Admin, SeniorAdmin |
| `getUnreadNotifications()` | Poll unread for current user | All roles |
| `markNotificationsRead()` | Dismiss notifications | All roles |

Internal: `_notify($queryId, $recipientId, $recipientRole, $type, $message)`:
1. Always inserts into `query_notifications` (in-app)
2. If `notif_email_enabled = 1` → fire `NotificationService::sendEmail()`
3. If `notif_sms_enabled = 1` → fire `NotificationService::sendSms()`

### New Model Files
- **`QueryResponseModel.php`** — [create()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Models/Query.php#15-42), `findByQuery()`, `addNote()`
- **`QueryNotificationModel.php`** — [create()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Models/Query.php#15-42), `getUnread($recipientId)`, `markRead()`
- **`QueryModel.php` additions** — `findAll()`, `findById()`, [update()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/AuctionController.php#266-325), `getCold()`, `pruneOld()`

### NEW: `core/Services/NotificationService.php`
```php
class NotificationService {
  static function sendEmail($to, $subject, $body) { /* PHPMailer or mail() */ }
  static function sendSms($phone, $message)        { /* HTTP POST to SMS gateway URL from settings */ }
}
```
Both methods check their respective `global_settings` flag before executing. Failures are logged to PHP error log (non-fatal).

