## Frontend — Per-Role Interfaces & JS

### Shared Additions to [global.js](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/assets/js/global.js)

| Function | Description |
|---|---|
| `initNotifBell()` | Reads `window.currentUser`, renders bell in header, starts polling |
| `pollNotifications()` | Polls `api/notifications/unread` on interval from `window.notifPollInterval` (set by PHP from `global_settings`); updates badge |
| `openQueryThreadModal(queryId)` | Slide-in panel: full thread view |
| `submitQueryResponse(queryId)` | POST to `api/queries/respond`; accepts optional forward-to selector |
| `closeQueryThread(queryId)` | Originator closes → `api/queries/close` |

Each dashboard page top `<script>` block also injects:
```php
window.notifPollInterval = <?= $notifPollInterval ?? 30 ?> * 1000;
```

### Notification Bell (all dashboards)
A `<div id="notifBell">` bell icon with badge count injected at the top of each dashboard's header bar. On click: opens a dropdown panel of unread notifications with links to threads.

### Admin & SeniorAdmin — New `admin_queries.php`

Panels:
1. **All Open Threads** — table (subject, creator, priority badge, status, assignee role, last-activity); filterable
2. **Thread Detail** (slide-in) — initial note + full response chain + per-response admin notes
3. **Cold Audit** — threads stale >4 days; sortable; action buttons per row
4. **Prune Control** — button + result count

**Admin JS Functions:**

| Function | Description |
|---|---|
| `loadAllQueryThreads(filters)` | `api/queries/list` → renders table |
| `openQueryDetail(queryId)` | `api/queries/thread` → renders panel |
| `assignQuery(queryId, assigneeId, role)` | POST `api/queries/assign` |
| `setPriorityOnQuery(queryId)` | Priority+assignee modal → POST `api/queries/set-priority` |
| `addNoteToResponse(responseId)` | Inline note → POST `api/queries/add-note` |
| `closeColdQueryAdmin(queryId)` | Password-auth modal → POST `api/queries/close-cold` |
| `tagColdForPriority(queryId)` | Priority+assignee modal → POST `api/queries/set-priority` |
| `initiatePrune()` | POST `api/queries/prune-archive` → show count |
| `loadColdAudit()` | GET `api/queries/cold-audit` → renders table |

### WHM, SBA, ZBDp, Agent — Blended

**"My Query Inbox"** panel added to each role's primary dashboard:

| Function | All 4 roles |
|---|---|
| `loadMyQueryInbox()` | `api/queries/list?assigned_to=me` |
| `openQueryThread(queryId)` | Thread view: read + respond |
| `submitResponse(queryId)` | Respond + optionally forward |
| `closeQueryThread(queryId)` | Close own originating threads |

