| Forward response to another role | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Counter-response notification | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Close own originating thread | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| View all open threads | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Assign unassigned query | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Set/reset priority | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Add admin note to response | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Prune archive (28-day) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Cold thread audit (4-day) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Force-close cold thread | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
