## Phased Implementation

### Phase 0 — Auth Session & Cookie Upgrade
- Add `staffLogin()`, `staffRegister()`, `logout()`, `checkSession()`, `verifyUser()` (scaffold) to [AuthController.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/AuthController.php)
- Add `authGuard()`, `currentUser()`, `forceLogin()`, `forceVerify()` helper functions to [core/helpers/functions.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/helpers/functions.php)
- Add new auth routes to [index.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/index.php)
- Seed new `global_settings` keys (`session_lifetime_minutes`, `session_secure_cookie`)
- Add `window.currentUser` PHP-injected JS variable to each dashboard (hardcoded for dev)
- Add `window.notifPollInterval` PHP-injected variable to each dashboard (read from `global_settings`)

### Phase 1 — Database Foundation
- `ALTER TABLE queries` — add 8 new columns
- `CREATE` 4 new tables (`query_responses`, `query_response_notes`, `query_notifications`, `query_audit_log`)
- Seed new `global_settings` keys for notification config
- Extend `QueryModel.php` with new methods
- Create `QueryResponseModel.php` and `QueryNotificationModel.php`
- Create `core/Services/NotificationService.php` (email + SMS stubs)

### Phase 2 — Core API Layer
- Register all new query + notification routes in [index.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/index.php)
- Implement all new [QueryController](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/QueryController.php#7-44) methods
- Build internal `_notify()` helper (in-app + conditional email/SMS)
- Refine [addQuery()](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/core/Controllers/QueryController.php#17-43) to accept `creator_id`/`creator_role` from JS `window.currentUser`

### Phase 3 — Notifications & Thread Viewing (All Roles)
- Extend [global.js](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/assets/js/global.js): bell, polling, thread modal, response submit, close thread
- Update all existing `submitQueryAction()` calls across all dashboards to pass `window.currentUser` fields
- Add **"My Query Inbox"** panel to: [whm_dashboard.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/whm_dashboard.php), [sba_dashboard.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/sba_dashboard.php), [zbdp_dashboard.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/zbdp_dashboard.php), [agent_dashboard.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/areabazaar/public/agent_dashboard.php)

### Phase 4 — Admin Query Management Hub
- Create `public/admin_queries.php`
- Add sidebar link in all `admin_*.php` pages
- Implement all admin JS functions: list, detail, assign, priority, note, close-cold, tag, prune, cold-audit
- Password-authenticated cold-close flow

### Phase 5 — Audit, Pruning & Cold Thread Tooling
- `closeColdQuery()` — validates admin password → writes to `query_audit_log`
- `pruneToArchive()` — batch-update `Archived` for closed threads >28 days; returns count
- `getColdThreads()` — `WHERE last_activity < NOW() - INTERVAL 4 DAY AND status = 'Open'`
- Cold Audit sortable table in `admin_queries.php`
- Prune button with success feedback

